# Google Places API key — used SERVER-SIDE to fetch live rating/review count.
# Set this in Vercel Dashboard → Settings → Environment Variables.
# Never use the VITE_ prefix — this key must never reach the client bundle.
# Get a key at https://console.cloud.google.com/ and enable the Places API (New).
# If omitted, Reviews section falls back to hardcoded values (5.0 / 37).
GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
